WEBVTT

00:00:01.381 --> 00:00:13.259
Yes, I embraced tenderness and devotion
sou itooshisa to kizuna wo daita

00:00:13.393 --> 00:00:18.956
Floating in unending space
hatenaki umi ni ukabu

00:00:18.999 --> 00:00:25.905
On this small planet
chiisa na hoshi de

00:00:26.406 --> 00:00:37.442
When I feel your warmth next to me
anata no nukumori wo soba ni kanjiru toki

00:00:37.617 --> 00:00:43.556
I understand the burden
inochi no omosa to

00:00:43.590 --> 00:00:50.962
And the transience of life
hakanasa wo shiru no

00:00:53.734 --> 00:00:58.772
Nights of sorrowful wandering
mayoinageku yoru mo

00:00:58.772 --> 00:01:05.645
And tearful mornings
namida no asa mo

00:01:05.645 --> 00:01:11.251
I believe in tomorrow
ashita wo shinjiru kara

00:01:11.251 --> 00:01:17.524
So I can make it through
koeteyukeru no

00:01:17.524 --> 00:01:25.954
To the continuation of the dream
yume no tsuzuki he

00:01:46.686 --> 00:01:50.524
Tina, I have always protected you.

00:01:50.524 --> 00:01:52.515
Tina.

00:02:03.503 --> 00:02:08.839
Ever since we were little,
I've always protected you.

00:02:09.042 --> 00:02:11.511
THE VOW

00:02:11.511 --> 00:02:13.814
THE VOW
My... Tina.

00:02:13.814 --> 00:02:14.405
My... Tina.

00:02:15.482 --> 00:02:17.950
Look! The Orsel emissions
have stopped!

00:02:20.387 --> 00:02:23.557
You're right!
The Orsel is disappearing!

00:02:23.557 --> 00:02:26.693
Then Princess Tina has stopped.

00:02:26.693 --> 00:02:28.395
She's stopped.

00:02:28.395 --> 00:02:32.627
Hurry! We have to
take care of the princess!

00:02:43.777 --> 00:02:48.009
The princess... Tina.
Please save her.

00:02:50.684 --> 00:02:52.879
This way!

00:03:01.061 --> 00:03:04.965
Tina, you couldn't hear my voice.

00:03:04.965 --> 00:03:08.162
But you could hear his voice!

00:03:15.709 --> 00:03:16.977
Hear me!

00:03:16.977 --> 00:03:21.014
We'll take advantage of this confusion
and force our way into Titus's palace!

00:03:21.014 --> 00:03:22.582
But don't kill the king!

00:03:22.582 --> 00:03:27.849
Capture Princess Tina,
and I want the scientists alive!

00:03:32.592 --> 00:03:35.720
We're going to remove the operating
mechanism from Princess Tina!

00:03:39.599 --> 00:03:41.430
Tina.

00:03:41.735 --> 00:03:43.965
X-scan projection.

00:03:47.774 --> 00:03:49.709
-What's the matter?!
-Something's wrong!

00:03:49.709 --> 00:03:52.946
It's not there! We can't see
the operating mechanism!

00:03:52.946 --> 00:03:57.317
That's impossible! Look carefully!
It should be under the left lung!

00:03:57.317 --> 00:03:59.785
It's not there! It's disappeared!

00:03:59.853 --> 00:04:03.123
Operating mechanism? Is that the
device that turns Tina into a weapon?

00:04:03.123 --> 00:04:05.258
Look for it carefully!
It couldn't have disappeared!

00:04:05.258 --> 00:04:08.161
So that means,
if that thing is gone,

00:04:08.161 --> 00:04:11.231
then Tina won't become a weapon
anymore, right?!

00:04:11.231 --> 00:04:14.200
That's impossible!
It couldn't have disappeared!

00:04:15.902 --> 00:04:18.063
W-What is this?!

00:04:21.441 --> 00:04:22.943
Soreto! What did you do?!

00:04:22.943 --> 00:04:26.980
What do you mean? All I did was enter
the operating mechanism's frequency.

00:04:26.980 --> 00:04:28.971
Zero point five six!

00:04:31.351 --> 00:04:33.520
The signal from the
operating mechanism

00:04:33.520 --> 00:04:35.784
is being sent back
from her whole body.

00:04:37.023 --> 00:04:38.325
What does that mean?

00:04:38.325 --> 00:04:42.362
The operating mechanism is embedded
throughout Princess Tina's whole body.

00:04:42.362 --> 00:04:44.731
How could this...

00:04:44.731 --> 00:04:46.633
The operating mechanism was
a foreign object,

00:04:46.633 --> 00:04:49.569
and the princess's body
has assimilated it.

00:04:49.569 --> 00:04:52.305
It's no use! We can't
change Princess Tina...

00:04:52.305 --> 00:04:55.035
back to...
back to normal anymore!

00:04:55.442 --> 00:04:58.812
Do something!
You people started all of this!

00:04:58.812 --> 00:05:01.508
Come on!
Change Tina back to normal!

00:05:04.451 --> 00:05:05.552
This is why!

00:05:05.552 --> 00:05:08.388
This is why it wasn't possible
to do something like this!

00:05:08.388 --> 00:05:10.379
It was too soon!

00:05:11.992 --> 00:05:14.085
If this continues...

00:05:14.494 --> 00:05:17.122
"If this continues," what?
What will happen?!

00:05:18.765 --> 00:05:20.700
That same thing could happen again,

00:05:20.700 --> 00:05:23.669
and you can't stop her from
becoming like that, right?

00:05:31.011 --> 00:05:34.742
There's really... nothing else
that can be done.

00:05:39.786 --> 00:05:41.488
I see.

00:05:41.488 --> 00:05:44.889
So you either have to destroy her
to fulfill your oath as a scientist.

00:05:45.358 --> 00:05:47.417
Or, as a human,

00:05:48.695 --> 00:05:50.788
I will have to kill her?

00:05:55.669 --> 00:05:58.297
That's what all this means, right?

00:06:03.610 --> 00:06:05.407
What are you?!

00:06:13.186 --> 00:06:16.553
Search for Tina! In Tanatulum!

00:06:18.625 --> 00:06:22.162
Enough! We have
taken over this palace.

00:06:22.162 --> 00:06:24.096
From now on,
you take orders from us!

00:06:29.202 --> 00:06:31.261
Blasted, stupid fools!

00:06:33.673 --> 00:06:35.642
Lord Gueroca is staging a rebellion!

00:06:35.642 --> 00:06:39.746
He's already taken over the east and
west wings of the palace! Your Majesty!

00:06:39.746 --> 00:06:42.874
Tina... my Tina...

00:06:44.017 --> 00:06:47.077
Is that my Tina?

00:06:47.520 --> 00:06:51.224
It's not Princess Tina!
Princess Tina is dead!

00:06:51.224 --> 00:06:52.959
Gotto... Gotto...

00:06:52.959 --> 00:06:55.028
At any rate, right now
we must get you hidden.

00:06:55.028 --> 00:06:58.327
We'll regroup and launch
a counterattack against Gueroca!

00:06:59.766 --> 00:07:04.567
Tina... Even though I have
always protected Tina...

00:07:07.874 --> 00:07:12.334
In Tina's heart, I don't exist!

00:07:12.579 --> 00:07:14.206
I...

00:07:17.283 --> 00:07:21.121
There's trouble! Gueroca has attacked
the palace and forced his way in!

00:07:21.121 --> 00:07:22.989
He's come to take away Princess Tina!

00:07:22.989 --> 00:07:25.150
We have to get out of here quickly!

00:08:25.285 --> 00:08:27.253
Tina.

00:08:41.067 --> 00:08:42.591
Tina.

00:08:48.575 --> 00:08:51.100
It's impossible for me, Tina.

00:08:52.011 --> 00:08:53.680
I can't do it.

00:08:53.680 --> 00:08:55.011
I...

00:08:55.048 --> 00:08:56.640
Tina.

00:09:06.392 --> 00:09:08.622
There is one other way.

00:09:15.802 --> 00:09:19.294
We'll transfer Princess Tina's
soul one more time!

00:09:20.406 --> 00:09:21.908
That impossible, Aghi!

00:09:21.908 --> 00:09:25.078
We don't have anymore artificial
matter to create a new body!

00:09:25.078 --> 00:09:27.046
Where do you intend to transfer her?

00:09:30.316 --> 00:09:32.452
200 million light years away.

00:09:32.452 --> 00:09:34.520
On the outskirts of
a super cluster of galaxies,

00:09:34.520 --> 00:09:37.080
there's a water planet
just like Greecia.

00:09:44.430 --> 00:09:46.489
Earth.

00:09:46.799 --> 00:09:50.003
Transfer her soul?

00:09:50.003 --> 00:09:53.339
Yes. As long as Princess
Tina's soul is gone,

00:09:53.339 --> 00:09:55.508
the mechanism will not function.

00:09:55.508 --> 00:09:59.946
The body that was left behind
will just decay like ordinary flesh.

00:09:59.946 --> 00:10:02.471
It won't become a weapon.

00:10:05.718 --> 00:10:07.709
Earth.

00:10:08.321 --> 00:10:12.553
Hurry! If Gueroca's troops
get here, we're done for!

00:10:19.499 --> 00:10:21.660
Earth.

00:10:24.804 --> 00:10:26.439
You heard them, Tina.

00:10:26.439 --> 00:10:28.441
Let's believe in them.

00:10:28.441 --> 00:10:32.378
No matter how far, in whatever form,

00:10:32.378 --> 00:10:36.280
the most important thing to me
is the fact that you'll be alive!

00:10:36.416 --> 00:10:38.051
I'm going, too.

00:10:38.051 --> 00:10:40.620
If I do that, we'll definitely
find each other again.

00:10:40.620 --> 00:10:42.622
You understand, right, Tina?

00:10:42.622 --> 00:10:44.613
We'll definitely meet each other again.

00:10:44.991 --> 00:10:46.788
Soran.

00:11:15.588 --> 00:11:17.590
The Orsel intensity is increasing.

00:11:17.590 --> 00:11:19.926
One hundred twenty-seven.
One hundred and seventy five.

00:11:19.926 --> 00:11:21.461
Two hundred and thirteen.

00:11:21.461 --> 00:11:23.622
The Zone is opening.

00:11:23.863 --> 00:11:25.431
Listen, Soran!

00:11:25.431 --> 00:11:28.167
When the lamp on
the capsule turns green,

00:11:28.167 --> 00:11:31.159
you can push the switch
whenever you're ready.

00:11:34.140 --> 00:11:36.040
-Do you understand?
-Yes.

00:11:51.657 --> 00:11:53.026
Soran.

00:11:53.026 --> 00:11:54.755
Tina!

00:11:59.899 --> 00:12:02.301
Soran! Soran!

00:12:02.301 --> 00:12:03.928
Tina!

00:12:12.779 --> 00:12:14.847
Tina! I promise I'll go!

00:12:14.847 --> 00:12:16.949
I promise I'll go to
wherever you are!

00:12:16.949 --> 00:12:18.551
Don't forget! Tina!

00:12:18.551 --> 00:12:22.388
Soran! I'll always be waiting for you!

00:12:22.388 --> 00:12:26.825
Until I see you again,
always! Always!

00:12:36.035 --> 00:12:39.163
What? What did you say?

00:12:44.911 --> 00:12:46.970
Soran!

00:12:54.387 --> 00:12:56.912
Soran! Soran!

00:13:12.738 --> 00:13:14.933
Seth?!

00:13:20.012 --> 00:13:21.980
Seth.

00:14:12.532 --> 00:14:15.365
Helga, Helga.

00:14:37.857 --> 00:14:40.087
Helga.

00:15:35.047 --> 00:15:36.782
I promise I'll go!

00:15:36.782 --> 00:15:40.149
I promise I'll go to
wherever you are!

00:15:40.920 --> 00:15:42.955
Don't forget!

00:15:42.955 --> 00:15:44.684
Tina!

00:16:54.927 --> 00:16:57.530
Helga has remembered
what happened on Greecia.

00:16:57.530 --> 00:17:00.522
She's remembered that
she was the princess, hasn't she?

00:17:01.233 --> 00:17:04.794
We've put her through a
terrible experience again.

00:17:11.444 --> 00:17:15.614
Helga... She's in so much pain,

00:17:15.614 --> 00:17:19.914
but there's nothing I can do.
I can't do anything for her.

00:17:20.820 --> 00:17:22.388
I...

00:17:22.388 --> 00:17:24.590
Helga is...

00:17:24.590 --> 00:17:26.581
Helga is...

00:17:30.396 --> 00:17:33.265
Hesma! Where's Hesma?

00:17:33.265 --> 00:17:35.501
Where could he have gone?

00:17:35.501 --> 00:17:37.036
It can't be!

00:17:37.036 --> 00:17:40.706
The horrible way that Kirchner died
has really been bothering me.

00:17:40.706 --> 00:17:44.377
If we don't do something,
we may end up facing the same fate.

00:17:44.377 --> 00:17:46.045
I want to get a hold of

00:17:46.045 --> 00:17:48.741
the data from Kirchner's
experiment before we go back.

00:17:50.249 --> 00:17:53.412
Soon. Soon we'll be able to go back.

00:17:56.055 --> 00:18:00.082
Cooks, has the chief decided on
your punishment yet?

00:18:00.259 --> 00:18:02.728
Three months suspension from duty.

00:18:02.728 --> 00:18:05.297
Of course, the investigation
in Nohedge has been closed,

00:18:05.297 --> 00:18:07.400
and all documentation
has been confiscated.

00:18:07.400 --> 00:18:08.701
And when I'm reinstated,

00:18:08.701 --> 00:18:10.498
I'll probably be transferred to
an office management position.

00:18:10.569 --> 00:18:12.938
But you're lucky you weren't killed!

00:18:12.938 --> 00:18:14.707
You were taken captive at
Gherta's research lab,

00:18:14.707 --> 00:18:17.369
and then I find that
you're being held here.

00:18:18.110 --> 00:18:20.012
I am a public servant, after all.

00:18:20.012 --> 00:18:23.082
It would be problematic if they
create a commotion by hurting me.

00:18:23.082 --> 00:18:26.643
It's better to just let the civil servant
be controlled by his superiors.

00:18:29.288 --> 00:18:31.857
-I'm getting out of here!
-What?!

00:18:31.857 --> 00:18:34.792
Even the chief is attempting to
cover up the Ged Group!

00:18:35.561 --> 00:18:38.264
Listen, at this rate, we're going to
find that the Kirchner's case,

00:18:38.264 --> 00:18:41.333
and the experiments that
Gherta is performing,

00:18:41.333 --> 00:18:43.502
are all going to be buried
away in the dark,

00:18:43.502 --> 00:18:45.094
we won't be able to get to them.

00:18:45.137 --> 00:18:48.629
Besides which,
I saw the Children of Befort!

00:18:49.909 --> 00:18:52.207
Alice, get undressed.

00:18:52.611 --> 00:18:54.977
What are you saying? You jerk!

00:18:56.215 --> 00:18:58.775
Is your visit over?

00:19:03.122 --> 00:19:04.419
Keep up the good work
guarding him.

00:19:04.490 --> 00:19:06.959
It's late, so be
careful going home.

00:19:06.959 --> 00:19:08.722
Okay!

00:19:10.729 --> 00:19:12.390
What'll I do?

00:19:23.042 --> 00:19:24.910
Professor!

00:19:24.910 --> 00:19:27.279
The boat to Kuril Island
will be leaving soon.

00:19:27.279 --> 00:19:29.982
-Okay.
-This is all your luggage, right?

00:19:29.982 --> 00:19:31.950
I'll carry it.

00:19:42.862 --> 00:19:45.965
I don't know if
it's true or not.

00:19:45.965 --> 00:19:48.033
But the person who came
and sold it to me

00:19:48.033 --> 00:19:50.002
claimed it was something
Professor Rugen treasured greatly

00:19:50.002 --> 00:19:51.663
while he was alive.

00:19:51.804 --> 00:19:55.608
The person said that he used to
work at the professor's house.

00:19:55.608 --> 00:19:59.977
But there's probably
no truth to that story.

00:20:25.204 --> 00:20:28.640
Damn it! All the data
has been erased!

00:20:30.209 --> 00:20:31.544
Who are you?

00:20:31.544 --> 00:20:35.310
Tell me! Where is the experimental
data on those pilots?

00:20:37.383 --> 00:20:39.552
You're interested in the experiment?

00:20:39.552 --> 00:20:42.421
Why? Why do you want to know?

00:20:42.421 --> 00:20:45.457
You stole our technology!

00:20:45.457 --> 00:20:49.291
The people on earth shouldn't be
able to interfere with the Zone.

00:20:49.595 --> 00:20:51.931
But when you look at what
happened to that pilot,

00:20:51.931 --> 00:20:54.266
he must have entered the Zone!

00:20:54.266 --> 00:20:57.703
You people performed the transfer of a
soul from and back to the same body,

00:20:57.703 --> 00:21:00.103
something we never did.

00:21:00.372 --> 00:21:04.274
On our planet, no one would ever
even think of something so terrible!

00:21:04.610 --> 00:21:07.212
Now I'm grateful to you
people for experimenting

00:21:07.212 --> 00:21:09.203
without any sense of ethics.

00:21:09.281 --> 00:21:10.849
Because data on the transfers
between the same body

00:21:10.849 --> 00:21:13.052
is something unknown to us as well.

00:21:13.052 --> 00:21:14.720
On our planet?

00:21:14.720 --> 00:21:17.489
Are you saying you people
came here from another planet?

00:21:17.489 --> 00:21:18.691
How?!

00:21:18.691 --> 00:21:19.858
For what purpose?!

00:21:19.858 --> 00:21:21.760
Never mind that, answer me!

00:21:21.760 --> 00:21:24.296
I need to get that data!
All of the data!

00:21:24.296 --> 00:21:27.493
So then you've found Tina, right?
Hesma!

00:21:35.174 --> 00:21:36.342
Dumas!

00:21:36.342 --> 00:21:39.311
This is what you want, isn't it?

00:22:35.801 --> 00:22:45.608
At the bottom of the deep, clear sea
fukaku fukaku sukitooru umi no soko ni

00:22:45.878 --> 00:22:55.721
A small flower is resting
chiisana hana madoronderu

00:22:55.721 --> 00:23:00.454
The melody of a gentle wind
amayaka na kaze no shirabe

00:23:00.492 --> 00:23:05.327
Passes through a rainbow
niji wo kuguri

00:23:05.731 --> 00:23:14.867
The fish are playing in the sky
sakanatachi wa sora ni asobu

00:23:15.007 --> 00:23:20.045
Everyone plays the music of love
dare mo ga ai wo kanaderu

00:23:20.045 --> 00:23:25.317
A warm light came down
atatakana hikari futteta

00:23:25.317 --> 00:23:29.720
(A gaze) That gaze
(manazashi wa) sono manazashi wa

00:23:29.755 --> 00:23:34.059
Is unbound and becomes full
hodokete michiteku

00:23:34.059 --> 00:23:38.928
Embraced by water
mizu ni dakare
